From 5f0af4e17743326d1d0caca3cbf69fbfd80501cc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Arena 9 <arena9@payesh.local>
Date: Wed, 23 Sep 2026 18:42:57 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(tests): close Arena 9 failure-boundary harness defects (6
 root causes)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Independent Architecture/Dependency/Failure-Boundary review on
main @ 66928be6227567f3d92b2c93a2d5f8146a4601b8 (E3, PG 17.11 +
Redis 8.0.2 + Node 22, live failure injection).

All six root causes are harness/regression-pin defects; no production
code path was changed. Production fail-closed behaviour was re-proven
before and after each fix.

1) chaos-drill-lib loginAs: prod demo_code guard (0b53ec0) correctly
   stopped echoing codes under NODE_ENV=production, which silently
   broke setup:login of ALL six chaos drills (6/6 FAIL since
   2026-09-19). Harness now mints a session JWT with the drill's
   runtime secret; server-side authority (HS256 verify, revocation,
   session-version, PG user/school lookups) still fully enforced.
   After fix: 6/6 drills PASS twice, incl. PG outage fail-closed
   window 25.6s with 0 false acks and disk-pressure ENOSPC recovery.

2) chaos-drill-disk-pressure: /api/health==200 assertion demanded a
   fake green while PG was PANIC-dead; locked contract (P0-13/server13)
   returns 503+diagnostic body when unhealthy. Assertion now requires
   a diagnosable 200/503 JSON response instead.

3) redis-prodfail A13: pinned pre-a3c213e behaviour (ping ok:true/
   memory in production w/o Redis). Re-pinned to the CURRENT correct
   fail-closed contract {ok:false,driver:none,REDIS_UNAVAILABLE}.
   Also hermetic: roles strip ambient DATABASE_URL/REDIS_URL.

4) redis-fallback + session-revocation + outbox unit suites: ambient
   DATABASE_URL/REDIS_URL flipped redis.isProduction() and produced
   5-6 false reds each (incl. C5-04 from ground truth: now 18/18 in
   all three postures). Harnesses now pin their own posture and
   isolate shared-Redis stale state (sessver:* no-TTL keys, OTP
   rate-limit keys) via dedicated logical DB, mirroring
   phase65-runtime-truth's isolation pattern.

5) redis-sentinel-failover: three harness defects hid a real-failover
   proof — missing connect() for the lazyConnect production client,
   shared --dir RDB collision, and Redis 8 repl-diskless-sync-delay=5s
   killing the master before first sync (empty replica promoted).
   Now 11/11 incl. genuine sentinel promotion observed by the app
   client config.

6) observability-config: rule_files regex anchored $ without /m so the
   canonical-alert-rules gate could never pass on any valid
   prometheus.yml with content after rule_files (dff14e0 kept the bad
   anchor). Replaced with a semantic single-entry block check;
   negative test (extra rules file) verified to fail.

Regression: npm test 35/35 + smoke 547/547, production-truth-gate
44/44 VERIFIED, production-verifier 37/37 VERIFIED, phase65 37/37,
all on this HEAD.
